    "title": "Mater Dei wins 8th straight with victory over Heritage Hills - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n1 hours ago\nLINCOLN CITY, Ind. (WEHT) — The Mater Dei Wildcats improve to 11-1 on the season after a 6-3 win over the Heritage Hills Patriots.\nThe Wildcats look to stay perfect in the SIAC on April 30 when they face the North Huskies. The Patriots look to bounce back on April 30 when they take on the Gibson Southern Titans.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
